codex-patch-overlay
Modified build of OpenAI Codex — https://github.com/openai/codex

The binaries and Nix packages distributed here are built from OpenAI Codex
(licensed under Apache-2.0, see LICENSE) with a small local patch stack applied.
The modifications are limited to the patches recorded in patches/manifest.toml.

The patches in this repository are original work; the upstream issue/PR links in
the manifest are references to the related feature requests, not the source of
the patch code.

